{"v":4,"catch":"體驗極限戰鬥的EVOLUTION！","desc":"忠實重現BEYBLADE X世界的戰鬥陀螺動作遊戲，以三大強力進化震撼登場！見證EVOBATTLE、EVOSTORY和EVOCUSTOMIZE！\n \n ■ 進化1：EVOBATTLE\n 不同戰鬥陀螺類型將使策略產生巨大變化。攻擊型專注進攻，耐力型吸收對手的耐力，防禦型發動護盾進行堅固防禦，平衡型則透過連擊提升攻擊力！體驗考驗技巧與精準度的高速戰鬥，並在線上挑戰世界各地的陀螺鬥士！\n \n ■ 進化2：EVOSTORY\n 新的夥伴正在等待你——在終極BEY BATTLE ROYALE (BBR)中一起競爭、成長並追逐夢想！\n \n ■ 進化3：EVOCUSTOMIZE\n 自訂達到全新高度！收集材料，為戰鬥陀螺塗上喜愛的顏色，強化常用零件，並選擇X Skills，打造最適合自己戰鬥風格的戰鬥陀螺！","publisher":"FURYU Corporation","release":"2026-11-11","genres":["動作","冒險","模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人 · 本機通訊 2 人 · 網路 2 人","langs":["英文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":2,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 5.8GB / Switch 2.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d80453c53579898b8e4982eaeb063c67904b25a2c09d94db08c5ef2f8d1f262a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c1d65558f6c84ae7b9afa499b7be1c1ea9f4e768445f2ef1719142a88123d427.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1adf760fbf4e9b0d33df77b1ecb49ceb8c74f2b44d8c3e4bc89d26728499fcb8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5c4e250479a1f442575a59348b06e876a44b0ddccf6d23584ee4b7c82198f899.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/75c222df20366c5adf060dec1de8eba9fbf6ca7592f147347cf8ffcb4901f2c0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3b6f6a71be9098134563e13d900c07802232fce5eeafd097a54d0f3496c83a5f.jpg"],"titleId":"01009f002286e000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000082424","name":"BEYBLADE X EVOBATTLE X-OVER BOOSTER","img":"dbf41448adccfd616762924ce601e1db250535bd82e929a7bc813140791e77b0","date":"2026-11-11","mem":false},{"id":"70050000082428","name":"BEYBLADE X EVOBATTLE SUPER BLADER PACK","img":"977ee6a4e45dd621ddd57044cae03ecf7dc12f80dc60aafa23958335349a2ee9","date":"2026-11-11","mem":false},{"id":"70050000082435","name":"BEYBLADE X EVOBATTLE DIGITAL BEYBOOSTER VOL.1","img":"e01ffff8bfc1f2723ace06fd725d4509d89c5f3ceb5e59ba467f915638401bb1","date":"2026-11-11","mem":false},{"id":"70050000082419","name":"BEYBLADE X EVOBATTLE DIGITAL BEYBOOSTER VOL.2","img":"53d0a3134d04e4d263f7236a